# Everything here is text: Markdown that a model reads and .mjs that node executes.
# CRLF buys nothing in either case, and a checkout that rewrites line endings turns an
# edit of one line into a whole-file diff. Normalise on commit and on checkout, so the
# repository looks the same from Windows, Linux and CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The hooks are executed directly; keep them LF regardless of any local core.autocrlf.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# No binaries today — the markers are here so a future asset is not silently mangled.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
